<title>UK: John Lewis UK store sales up 4.3% in latest week.</title>
<headline>John Lewis UK store sales up 4.3% in latest week.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The John Lewis Partnership said its UK weekly department store sales rose 4.3 percent in the week to August 9 from the same week a year earlier.</p>
<p>In the two weeks to August 9, sales were up 7.5 percent.</p>
<p>Total sales, including the Waitrose supermarket group, rose 6.5 percent in the latest week and 7.9 percent in the two week period.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7708</p>
